cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the derived panel, please cite both the software and the accompanying article."
title: "peatfire-eval: panel construction and evaluation-protocol experiments for district-month fire severity forecasting in West Kalimantan"
abstract: >-
  Code and derived data for a study of how evaluation-protocol choices affect model
  rankings in fire hotspot prediction. Builds a district-month panel of VIIRS S-NPP
  active fire detections for the 14 districts of West Kalimantan, Indonesia, and
  evaluates seven forecasting models under a 2x2 design crossing the test distribution
  with the discrimination metric.
